<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>How to Lover</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">TeYo</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">How to Lover</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3zRQtuzRCPd7gsHXTjw87I</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.701" end="00:18.985">(Don't)let the sheep take over you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.985" end="00:23.451">and i will be right there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.451" end="00:26.942">oh~I konw what I'm supposed to do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.942" end="00:30.319">but if I can say it clear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.319" end="00:35.837">I get so lost inside my head，sometimes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.837" end="00:38.640">I have conversations with myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.640" end="00:42.389">but when I'm with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.389" end="00:46.041">I love finally speaking to somebody else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.041" end="00:52.781">you know I~I~I~ have been searching</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.781" end="00:55.209">but I(thiink I've found my lover)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.209" end="00:57.101">think I've found my lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.101" end="01:01.640">And I don't know how to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.640" end="01:03.239">I don;t know how to love her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.239" end="01:07.162">Like her~spite her~I will try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.162" end="01:10.620">you're the only thing that's on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.620" end="01:18.620">I want to figure out how to do this right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.652" end="01:21.470">Oh,I don't know what to do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.470" end="01:23.445">So no,stuck in these shoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.445" end="01:24.945">He's acting like I never met</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.477" end="01:25.997">that's what I told you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.997" end="01:29.519">That's what you told him,too turn around I'm so confused</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.519" end="01:31.563">all these other people that've got the groove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.563" end="01:33.498">How I wish I could say that I got it too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.498" end="01:35.075">but this is new to me and it's not for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.075" end="01:39.199">I get so lost inside my head，sometimes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.199" end="01:42.862">I have conversations with myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.862" end="01:46.555">but when I'm with you~~</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.555" end="01:54.555">I love finally speaking to somebody else~~</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.064" end="02:06.568" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">( somebody else~~)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.568" end="02:12.167">you know I~I~I~ have been searching</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.167" end="02:17.117">but I(thiink I've found my lover)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.117" end="02:21.354">And I don't know how to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.354" end="02:23.251">I don;t know how to love her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.251" end="02:27.007">Like her~spite her~I will try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.007" end="02:31.207">you're the only thing that's on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.207" end="02:39.207">I want to figure out how to do this right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.693" end="02:44.693" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(O 。O wo~ho~)</p></div></body></tt>